  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>, then <math><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>"
